WEBVTT

00:03:59.616 --> 00:04:01.265
Ai do te thoshte--

00:04:01.265 --> 00:04:03.352
HP: Zbraze mendjen tende.

00:04:03.352 --> 00:04:04.416
(Te qeshura)

00:04:04.416 --> 00:04:10.429
Ji pa forme, pa konture, si uji.

00:04:10.429 --> 00:04:12.419
Tani, mbushe nje gote me uje.

00:04:12.419 --> 00:04:15.315
Uji behet gota.

00:04:15.315 --> 00:04:18.422
Hedh uje ne nje shishe dhe uji behet shishja.

00:04:18.422 --> 00:04:21.801
Hidhe ne nje cajnik e behet cajniku.

00:04:21.801 --> 00:04:24.450
Pra, uji mund te rrjedhe

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:27.100
ose mund te perplaset.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.455
Jini si uji, miqte e mi. (Duartrokitje)